%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThen please wake me up around noon. I promised to have\nlunch with Mitoko today.\d%K%P
「还有，请在天亮的时候把我叫起来。\n我和美都子约好了，她要帮我做午餐」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAah?!\d%K%P
「啊啊」%K%P
With that, I turned my back to Ms. Kaya, and lay down on\nthe floor, using my hands as a makeshift pillow.%K%P
话音一落，我便转过身去背对着夏夜小姐，\n然后枕在自己的胳膊上随意躺了下来。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell then, good night!\d%K%P
「最后，晚安～了！」%K%P
She must have been upset by this development, as I could\nfeel her naked feet kicking me in the back as I faked\nsleep.%K%P
对我故意表现出来的无视，\n夏夜小姐用她那光着的脚丫子，\n向我的后背一下又一下地狠狠踢着。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSon of a bitch! You gonna keep a woman in a yukata\nwaiting like that?! I may as well just go back to sitting\ncross-legged!\d%K%P
「真过分～。\n穿着浴衣的女孩子坐在旁边竟然没有反应。\n再这样的话我就像平常一样盘腿坐了哦」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI would highly advise against doing that while wearing a\nyukata.\d%K%P
「穿着浴衣盘腿就缺少情趣啦～」%K%P
I figured it could look pretty sexy. There was no way I\nwouldn't react.%K%P
不过，多半会变得相当性感吧。\n肯定不可能会没有反应的吧。%K%P
But I couldn't let myself be distracted by these things\nright now.%K%P
但是，绝对不能产生反应。%K%P
Manners were important even in indulgence, and being the\nsubject of another's kindness came with a certain kind of\nresponsibility.%K%P
渴望向她撒娇的话，就得先有允许她撒娇的度量。\n想要接纳她的话，就必须做好理解她的觉悟。%K%P
I had yet to reach a point where I could give her an\nanswer regarding both my feelings and position.%K%P
对于我来说，不管是从心态上，还是从能力上，\n都没有达到能够包容这个人的境界。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh, Christ... Trying to woo an impotent guy like you is\nsuch a drag.\d%K%P
「真够了。\n{无能:阳痿}的人真是糟糕」%K%P
As such, I had no choice but to take this verbal abuse.\nAfter all, half of what she said was true.%K%P
所以说，除了挨骂外别无他法。\n毕竟，这诽谤的话语，在某种意义上说也是真实的。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou see, my standards aren't particularly high, so I\ndon't know how to react to women of your caliber.\d%K%P
「我啊，理想是很低的啊，\n对你这样高规格的女性起不了反应呢～」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSo I'm too out of your reach? Are you talking about\nheight or age here? Or both?\d%K%P
「低的是身高吗？\n还是年龄吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d............\d%K%P
「………………………」%K%P
And here I thought I could take any kind of verbal\nabuse...%K%P
本来我已经下定了决心不去在意的。%K%P
It took me over ten minutes to fall asleep after that.%K%P
但因为这诽谤的话语，\n我真正睡着是在那１０分钟之后——这我是不会说的。%K%P
